    "title": "API-DocTest-List Telecom Sim Historys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM History Retrieval API allows users to access historical data related to SIM cards in a telecom system. This endpoint provides detailed records of SIM usage, including activation dates, service changes, and transactions. It is primarily utilized by telecom operators and customer support teams to track SIM card activities and provide insights for customer inquiries. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance their service offerings and improve customer engagement through data-driven decisions.",
